# w3id.org/em — LEGACY ALIAS of w3id.org/extendedmatrix
#
# Extended Matrix (CNR-ISPC). Contact: Emanuel Demetrescu
# <emanuel.demetrescu@cnr.it>, https://github.com/ExtendedMatrix
#
# The Extended Matrix space is /extendedmatrix (perma-id/w3id.org#6722). Before
# it was registered, the tools emitted IRIs under /em: the ontology
# (https://w3id.org/em/ontology#…, in RDF already delivered), the node IRIs of
# the RDF export (https://w3id.org/em/id/…), the first em.json schema
# (https://w3id.org/em/schemas/em.v1.schema.json). Those IRIs cannot be
# rewritten in the data that carries them. This directory does not open a new
# namespace: it makes the old one an alias, and every request under /em goes to
# the same path under /extendedmatrix, where the registered rules decide.

Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on

# the ontology keeps its content negotiation in the /extendedmatrix rules
RewriteRule ^ontology/?$ https://w3id.org/extendedmatrix/ontology [R=302,L]

# everything else, same path
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://w3id.org/extendedmatrix/$1 [R=302,L]
